  "differences": [
    "n061 carries A1BL, not A14E: no ordinary building registration for removal; native combat h0QD carries A14E.",
    "n062/n07O carry A14F: register removal on caster and5s repeating blessing; combat h0QE/h0UX.",
    "Filter tests caster n061/n062, not candidate; no alive/notself filter in JASS; native order can reject selected corpse/self without retry.",
    "Reservoir calls GetRandomInt for every candidate includingfirst. Enumeration happens even on widget death before destroying the super trigger.",
    "BF argument to RegisterSupperMummyAbility is unused; QE=A14E drives registration and target qualification.",
    "Four successes,notfour attempts; command acceptance immediately grants ability before spell-effect events; no timer refresh when A14F removed.",
    "Widget death adds2.01s one-shot to existing removal trigger, not a2s resurrection. Removal applies to the original handle and can remove a newly re-added copy."
  ],
  "nativeEvidence": [
    {
      "url": "https://github.com/Cokemonkey11/wc3-ability-doc/blob/main/sources/screwthetrees-wc3-editor-ability-insight-document/2023-11-14.md",
      "kind": "primary author experiment notes",
      "summary": "AOre tested1.31.1 depends on mana and hidden/pathing state; ANcl tested1.28.5 has no native gameplay effect and consumes mana/channels. This is not A14E same-version runtime proof."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://www.hiveworkshop.com/threads/issuetargetorder-returns-boolean.162518/",
      "kind": "author API behavior report",
      "summary": "Reports order failure for missing ability,mana,stun,silence,pause; used only to bound instant host adaptation."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://xgm.guru/p/wc3/197452",
      "kind": "native event behavior report",
      "summary": "Distinguishes TriggerRegisterDeathEvent widget callback during reincarnation from normal UNIT_DEATH; host currently delivers terminal death only."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://classic.battle.net/war3/neutral/centaurs.shtml",
      "kind": "Blizzard unit guide",
      "summary": "Creep Reincarnation guide lists90mana; cannot apply it as custom A14E Cost1. Contrasts with hero AOre guide and demonstrates why missing fields are unresolved."
    }
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "A14E Cost1 is absent; full native activation,health/mana restoration,death and revive event separation,buff and handle persistence not implemented. No revival scheduled by this batch.",
    "A14F instant mana spend and cooldown are host adaptation; native command acceptance versus actual cast,Cast1,DataA1/FollowThrough,DataD1,cast point/backswing and order collisions unresolved.",
    "Native enumeration order,PRNG,alliance/owner mapping,hidden/locust candidates and removed/corpse handles remain partial; host candidate pool contains currently retained entities and kings.",
    "Widget-death callback is a distinct module entry but automatic dispatch currently follows host terminal unit death only; same-frame timer/death order unresolved.",
    "A1BL Asth native behavior has no direct JASS use; retained unresolved building carrier,not promoted to marker based only on tooltip."
  ]
}
